# codecs/json: to-json handles null ([]) and bool values
[include %libdir "codecs/json.llt"]

---

[to-json [null: [] yes: true no: false]]
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: to-json (did you mean the string "to-json"? Use quotes.) (defined at 5:2-5:9)

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: to-json
